{
  "flow": "<section class=\"lab\" aria-label=\"算法分支数据流\"><span class=\"lab-label\">ACTUAL ARCHITECTURE</span><h3>先选一条实际运行链路</h3><div class=\"flow-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"运行模式\"><button id=\"tab-local\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"flow-panel\" data-flow=\"local\">S05 局部运动</button><button id=\"tab-mapping\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"flow-panel\" data-flow=\"mapping\" tabindex=\"-1\">S06 建图回环</button><button id=\"tab-regional\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"flow-panel\" data-flow=\"regional\" tabindex=\"-1\">S14 区域定位</button></div><div id=\"flow-panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-local\" tabindex=\"0\"><div id=\"flow-nodes\" class=\"flow-row\"></div><p id=\"flow-note\" class=\"lab-caption\"></p></div></section>",
  "ekf": "<section class=\"lab\" aria-label=\"轮速降权教学实验\"><span class=\"lab-label\">LAB 01 · SYNTHETIC</span><h3>轮速很自信，但它可能正在打滑</h3><p class=\"description\">一维教学：先验速度 0.40 m/s、方差 0.04；激光观测 0.42 m/s、方差 0.01；轮速报告 0.70 m/s。先更新激光，再改变轮速方差。与生产 15 状态 EKF 分开理解。</p><div class=\"preset\"><button id=\"wheel-normal\" type=\"button\">正常方差 0.0025</button><button id=\"wheel-slip\" type=\"button\">疑似滑移方差 4.0</button></div><div class=\"control-row\"><label for=\"wheel-r\">轮速观测方差 R（对数刻度）</label><input id=\"wheel-r\" type=\"range\" min=\"-4\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.00001\" value=\"-2.60206\"><output id=\"wheel-r-value\" for=\"wheel-r\"></output></div><div class=\"metrics\" aria-live=\"polite\"><div class=\"metric\"><small>融合后的速度</small><b id=\"velocity-result\"></b><span>m/s</span></div><div class=\"metric\"><small>轮速 Kalman 增益</small><b id=\"wheel-gain\"></b><span>越小，越少跟随轮速</span></div><div class=\"metric\"><small>轮速更新前的估计</small><b>0.416</b><span>m/s · 来自先验＋激光</span></div></div><div class=\"bar-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div id=\"gain-bar\" class=\"bar\"></div></div><p class=\"lab-caption\">大 R 表示这次测量更不确定；不是把 0.70 m/s 强行改成 0。</p></section>",
  "graph": "<section class=\"lab\" aria-label=\"回环图优化教学实验\"><span class=\"lab-label\">LAB 02 · SYNTHETIC</span><h3>回环怎样重新分配漂移</h3><p class=\"description\">固定起点 x₀=0；里程计两条边都测得 1.1 m；回环认为终点距起点 2.0 m。调节回环权重，观察优化后的两个节点。</p><div class=\"control-row\"><label for=\"loop-weight\">回环边的相对权重</label><input id=\"loop-weight\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"20\" step=\"0.5\" value=\"1\"><output id=\"loop-value\" for=\"loop-weight\"></output></div><svg id=\"graph-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 650 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"一维位姿图优化前后节点位置\"></svg><div class=\"metrics\" aria-live=\"polite\"><div class=\"metric\"><small>优化后 x₁</small><b id=\"graph-x1\"></b><span>m</span></div><div class=\"metric\"><small>优化后 x₂</small><b id=\"graph-x2\"></b><span>m</span></div><div class=\"metric\"><small>与回环观测的终点差</small><b id=\"graph-error\"></b><span>m · 不必严格为零</span></div></div></section>",
  "tf": "<section class=\"lab\" aria-label=\"坐标修正教学实验\"><span class=\"lab-label\">LAB 03 · SYNTHETIC</span><h3>修正全局参考，局部轨迹保持连续</h3><p class=\"description\">教学局部轨迹终点为 (2, 1) m。map→odom 的平移固定为 (0.4, −0.2) m，调整旋转角度。下图展示原局部坐标与变换后坐标的数值关系。</p><div class=\"control-row\"><label for=\"tf-yaw\">map→odom 旋转</label><input id=\"tf-yaw\" type=\"range\" min=\"-20\" max=\"20\" step=\"1\" value=\"10\"><output id=\"tf-yaw-value\" for=\"tf-yaw\"></output></div><svg id=\"tf-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 650 260\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"原局部轨迹和全局变换后的轨迹\"></svg><div class=\"metrics\" aria-live=\"polite\"><div class=\"metric\"><small>局部终点保持不变</small><b id=\"tf-local\">2.000, 1.000</b><span>odom 坐标 / m</span></div><div class=\"metric\"><small>变换后 x</small><b id=\"tf-x\"></b><span>map 坐标 / m</span></div><div class=\"metric\"><small>变换后 y</small><b id=\"tf-y\"></b><span>map 坐标 / m</span></div></div></section>",
  "gnss": "<section class=\"lab\" aria-label=\"GNSS 创新门控教学实验\"><span class=\"lab-label\">LAB 04 · SYNTHETIC</span><h3>fixed 也可能被拒绝</h3><p class=\"description\">只考察 XY 创新门控：r=(偏差, 0)，GNSS 标准差 0.04 m，参考方差 0.0025 m²，S=0.0041 I。生产代码还检查时效、协方差、地图版本等条件。</p><div class=\"control-row\"><label for=\"gnss-offset\">GNSS 与预测位置的偏差</label><input id=\"gnss-offset\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"40\" step=\"1\" value=\"16\"><output id=\"gnss-offset-value\" for=\"gnss-offset\"></output></div><div class=\"metrics\" aria-live=\"polite\"><div class=\"metric\"><small>距离 ≤ 0.15 m</small><b id=\"distance-state\"></b><span>物理偏移限制</span></div><div class=\"metric\"><small>NIS ≤ 9.21</small><b id=\"nis-value\"></b><span id=\"nis-state\"></span></div><div class=\"metric\"><small>这两项门控的结论</small><b id=\"gnss-result\"></b><span>要求同时通过</span></div></div><p class=\"lab-caption\">16 cm 时 NIS≈6.24，统计门限通过，但距离超限，因此拒绝。</p></section>",
  "quiz": "<section class=\"lab\" aria-label=\"阅读自测\"><span class=\"lab-label\">CHECK YOUR UNDERSTANDING</span><h3>用三个判断检查理解</h3><div class=\"quiz-q\" data-answer=\"false\" data-feedback=\"查看 local_estimator.yaml：S05 只配置了轮速、IMU 与激光增量；相机不在其中。\"><p>① 相机图像直接进入 S05 的 EKF。</p><button type=\"button\" data-choice=\"true\">正确</button><button type=\"button\" data-choice=\"false\">错误</button><output class=\"quiz-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></output></div><div class=\"quiz-q\" data-answer=\"false\" data-feedback=\"SurfaceMap.align() 只求 x、y、yaw；三维输入不等于六自由度优化。\"><p>② S14 使用三维激光，所以区域匹配估计完整六自由度。</p><button type=\"button\" data-choice=\"true\">正确</button><button type=\"button\" data-choice=\"false\">错误</button><output class=\"quiz-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></output></div><div class=\"quiz-q\" data-answer=\"false\" data-feedback=\"fixed 和 TF 都不充分；还要看创新、时效、航向、版本和 navigation_allowed 等条件。\"><p>③ GNSS fixed 并且 TF 存在，就可以继续行驶。</p><button type=\"button\" data-choice=\"true\">正确</button><button type=\"button\" data-choice=\"false\">错误</button><output class=\"quiz-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></output></div></section>"
}
